{"tmdb":1458099,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Harry Lehman is an aging pickpocket who plies his trade with ever-diminishing returns in a drastically changed New York. Wallets stuffed with cash have been replaced by easily cancelled credit cards, and Harry struggles to make ends meet as he cares for his disabled wife, Rosie. When he unwittingly purloins and fences a valuable USB stick, Harry finds himself in a race against time to return the loot or face the rage of a vengeful crime family.","directors":[{"name":"Noah Segan","id":48312}],"cast":[{"actor":"John Turturro","role":"Harry","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6O9W9cJW0kCqMzYeLupV9oH0ftn.jpg","tmdb":1241},{"actor":"Will Price","role":"Dylan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7Gv2bTLOxuPSkcIMRuPpEXcHFn4.jpg","tmdb":2348730},{"actor":"Steve Buscemi","role":"Ben","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/n0pZumkrcZrAPMoPq684RhYnjPV.jpg","tmdb":884},{"actor":"Giancarlo Esposito","role":"Detective Warren","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/MJOo4QZgMAb3y8QzOUDVFQusQZ.jpg","tmdb":4808},{"actor":"Jamie Lee Curtis","role":"Moira","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eWKubKAAssRzmFwCZKh1mdYqGCH.jpg","tmdb":8944},{"actor":"Tatiana Maslany","role":"Kelly","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pdoZ5tgZt1IdBXckGtyqRJ9DoJB.jpg","tmdb":61134},{"actor":"Karina Arroyave","role":"Rosie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dsMtfSCLeL6xAQF1XHNH3QF0E97.jpg","tmdb":18282},{"actor":"Victoria Moroles","role":"Eve","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ihnzexDHpbzBToHbT3U5LHckTcK.jpg","tmdb":1491255},{"actor":"Delaney Grace Coyle","role":"","photo":null,"tmdb":6563727},{"actor":"Rob Brown","role":"Sammy, An Orderly","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jVevsp9OsdImQ8YxNjdG3KLYket.jpg","tmdb":10689},{"actor":"Echaka Agba","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fi7fo24qCj0JCY0S1dzi1NzMC7u.jpg","tmdb":2455524},{"actor":"Ethan Herschenfeld","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aHN